  "description": "FtpSharpLib.Core is a robust .NET library designed for efficient FTP operations.\n\t\t\tThis version introduces recursive FTP file listing, improved asynchronous method handling,\n\t\t\tand enhanced FTP file parsing responses. Ideal for developers looking for a reliable\n\t\t\tsolution for managing FTP interactions in their applications.\n\t\t\tFile upload, download, GetFiles, etc. operations work with this library.",
